# *
# * \par FILE        :  S_NWC_PRODIO_Common.cf
# *
# * \par TYPE        :  (PRIVATE) Product Configuration File for COMMON Containers
# *
# * \par FUNCTION    :
# *                     Defines Product information to be used by PRODIO
# *                     to generate NWC/GEO product in netCDF format
